<title>NETHERLANDS: Pirelli suspended on Amsterdam exchange.</title>
<headline>Pirelli suspended on Amsterdam exchange.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Pirelli-Tyre holding NV, an 81 percent owned Dutch-listed unit of Italy's Pirelli SpA, have been suspended until further notice on the Amsterdam stock exchange pending an announcement, the exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>No further details were given. -- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
